+# deployment still works.  Size at 30k ctx with spec=3 on sm120 TP=8:
+#   attn_logits: (512, 8, 64, 513) float32 = 538 MB  (vs 61× that per-layer)
+#   o:           (512, 8, 512)    bf16    = 4 MB
